From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 15:34:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [Anti Detection?] Fix up! Dynamic Resource ID
 conflict caused apps crash issue
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

In LineageOS, the packageid of LineageOS SDK is fixed at 0x3f. At this case when apps (e.g. Alipay) tried also use
dynamic resource addressed at 0x3f will lead to accidentally read resource of LineageSDK then cause crash

We fix it by adding a gate and create a 'shadow package', when a user application tries to read resource at 0x3f,
system will passthrough it to the resource of the application itself instead of hit Lineage SDK one

